OL,3,AZelensky rallies EU support as Trump
OL,4,Asays Ukraine leader 'more difficult to
OL,5,Adeal with than Putin'
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS President Donald Trump has renewed
OL,8,Fhis sharp criticism of Volodymyr
OL,9,FZelensky, saying the Ukrainian leader
OL,10,Fis "more difficult to deal with than
OL,11,F[Russian President Vladimir] Putin".
OL,13,FSpeaking to US media on Thursday
OL,14,Fevening, Trump also called Ukraine's
OL,15,Ffresh wave of strikes on Russian oil
OL,16,Frefineries a "disgrace".
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
