OL,3,AZelensky rallies EU support as Trump
OL,4,Asays Ukraine leader 'more difficult to
OL,5,Adeal with than Putin'
OL,6,
OL,7,FZelensky, who is in Brussels for a
OL,8,Fsummit with EU leaders, had paused the
OL,9,Fattacks for three days at Trump's
OL,10,Frequest for a ceasefire on energy
OL,11,Ftargets, but said on Thursday the
OL,12,Fstrikes would resume because Moscow had
OL,13,Fnever stopped.
OL,15,FMeanwhile, deadly attacks on Ukraine
OL,16,Fcontinued overnight, with several
OL,17,Fpeople killed in a Russian drone strike
OL,18,Fin the north-eastern city of Kharkiv,
OL,19,Fthe regional governor said.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
